        "num": 1,
        "text": "Official English Q&A for P-145 (Jun. 28, 2024)"
      }
    ],
    "rulings": [
      {
        "answer": "No, it doesn’t activate.  [EX5-070 X Antibody Proto Form]'s inherited effect will trigger/activate \"when this Digimon would leave the battle area other than by one of your effects,\" but since [EX5-070 X Antibody Proto Form] isn't in this Digimon's digivolution cards at the time of activation of the [On Deletion] effect because it's placed in your security stack before this Digimon is deleted, the \"if [X Antibody] was in this Digimon's digivolution cards\" condition isn't met, so the effect doesn't activate.",
        "question": "If [EX5-070 X Antibody Proto Form] is in this Digimon's digivolution cards, this Digimon would be deleted, and [EX5-070 X Antibody Proto Form]'s inherited effect places it on top of my security stack, does this Digimon's [On Deletion] effect activate?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      }
    ]
  },
